{"id":"msg_m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_n102","label":"N102 · Nikke"},"label":"4. Teacher!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_n102_03","next":"msg_m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_02","speakers":{"anne_w":"Anne"},"icons":{"anne_w":"si_c121_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_1","text":"Teacher!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_2","text":"Do you remember Emma's cooking last time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_3","text":"Wasn't it delicious?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_4","text":"I could go for seconds.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_5","text":"Do you actually mean that?","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_7"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_6","text":"You really crack me up, Anne.","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_14"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_7","text":"Of course! It was super good!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_8","text":"You don't think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_9","text":"Oh right, I remember you didn't eat very much of it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_10","text":"Let's just say Emma and I have different tastes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_11","text":"Oh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_12","text":"I didn't realize.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_13","text":"I thought everyone liked her cooking.","jump":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_14","text":"What are you talking about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_15","text":"Good kids would never eat that kind of stuff.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_16","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_17","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_17","text":"... I've said too much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_18","text":"How about we try something other than Emma's cooking?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_19","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_20","text":"Nothing else has come remotely close to her cooking,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_21","text":"so I'm open to new things.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_22","text":"Sounds like you're happy eating nothing but Emma's cooking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_23","text":"I sure am!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_24","text":"Even when she makes the same dish,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_25","text":"it tastes different every time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_26","text":"Don't you think that's impressive?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_27","text":"Either way though, I'll try something new if it's a recommendation from you, Teacher.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_28","text":"What are you in the mood for?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_29","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_30","text":"I heard there's a new fusion restaurant in the Ark that specializes in croquettes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_31","text":"Can we go there?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_32","text":"They must have all sorts of crazy new flavors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_33","text":"Let's go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_34","text":"Okay!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anne_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anne_miraclefairy_01_35","text":"This is gonna be great!","jump":null}],"chat":true}